WEBVTT

29:01.398 --> 29:02.439
Tackle him!

29:02.524 --> 29:05.109
No, no, no! Wait!
I can explain everything!

29:05.193 --> 29:08.112
Okay, Mom, be right down.
I've gotta get Buzz.

29:08.196 --> 29:09.321
Retreat!

29:14.285 --> 29:16.286
Mom, do you know
where Buzz is?

29:16.371 --> 29:17.871
No, I haven't seen him.

29:20.417 --> 29:23.919
-Andy, I'm heading out the door!
-But, Mom, I can't find him!

29:24.003 --> 29:26.463
Honey, just grab some other toy.
Now, come on!

29:26.714 --> 29:28.549
Oh, okay.
